{title: All People That on Earth Do Dwell}
{artist: William Kethe · Old Hundredth}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 80}

Verse 1
[G]All people [D]that on [Em]earth do [C]dwell, sing [G]to the [C]Lord with [D]cheerful [G]voice;
him [G]serve with [D]mirth, his [Em]praise forth [C]tell — come [G]ye be[Em]fore him [D]and re[G]joice.
